/target
# Cargo.lock IS committed — this workspace ships binaries/a DLL, so locked, reproducible
# builds matter (CI runs with --locked).
# No .udf files in the repo at all — they may carry confidential legal content. Test inputs
# live locally (e.g. fixtures/sample.udf, kept on disk but untracked) and real samples are
# swept via the UDF_SAMPLE_DIR env var.
*.udf
/fixtures/private/

# Only README.md is tracked; all other .md (design specs, notes) stay local-only.
*.md
!README.md
